# No SPA fallback rules.
#
# Every real route (/game/<slug>, /privacy, /terms, /cookies, /about and /) is
# prerendered to static HTML by scripts/prerender.mjs, so Cloudflare Pages
# serves those files directly and no rewrite is needed.
#
# The original "/* /index.html 200" wildcard made every unknown path return
# HTTP 200 with the SPA shell — including /ads.txt, which is an automatic
# ad-network validation failure. Exact-match rules pointing at /index.html
# were tried next but Cloudflare normalises that destination into a 308 to /,
# which sent /privacy to the homepage. Leaving this file rule-free lets
# missing URLs return a proper 404 (see public/404.html).
